3ddee02c7b6b97658f3f 3x"}, "body": "I was deeply attracted by your drawing, so I sent this request, do you mind drawing my original characters?\n\nG (the kid): He is an undead monster who has lived a long time. He is vivacious and outgoing, he's got a lot of strength, and sometimes he is cruel and bloodthirsty.\nH (the man): Age 30-35. He's the sexy and elegant type, thin(so doesn't have a lot of muscle) and neutral in appearance. He used to be an aristocrat, sometimes a little tsundere.\nThey live somewhere like modern Europe, and they are close roommates and shared the villa with two other roommates.\n\nThey are good roommates and friends. They often go to explore strange shops or go on adventures together. In this process, G is the stronger party. Usually, he proposes to do something, but in daily life, G is very accommodating H.\n\nPlease draw freely, hope they are doing things together in one scene, but if possible, hope there is no bloody element.\n\nIf you feel something inappropriate about this request, please feel free to cancel it, thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1L8QbXxAR_-sWJTBcRZjDf2W2vZkxyDWE?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ononigiri/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2098934, "client_id": 1036334, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0e7151e3/uploads/origins/3d77a29a-9a14-4281-b732-423adbfde7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8963be67178ffa770a4c325c09b62ecc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0e7151e3/uploads/origins/3d77a29a-9a14-4281-b732-423adbfde7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8963be67178ffa770a4c325c09b62ecc, https://si.imgix.net/0e7151e3/uploads/origins/3d77a29a-9a14-4281-b732-423adbfde7bc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit